<title>LUXEMBOURG: SOCCER-BULGARIA BEAT LUXEMBOURG 2-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BULGARIA BEAT LUXEMBOURG 2-1.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria beat Luxembourg 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-1) in a World Cup soccer European group five</p>
<p>qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Luxembourg - Roby Langers (20th)</p>
<p>Bulgaria - Krasimir Balakov (14th, penalty), Emil Kostadinov</p>
<p>(37th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,800</p>
<p>Group five standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Russia	     1   1   0   0   4   0   3</p>
<p> Israel	     1   1   0   0   2   1   3</p>
<p> Bulgaria	   2   1   0   1   3   3   3</p>
<p> Luxembourg	 1   0   0   1   1   2   0</p>
<p> Cyprus	     1   0   0   1   0   4   0</p>
<p>Next match: Oct 9 Israel v Russia</p>
</text>
